. ❯ [.[].people[] | select(.age > $root[0].people[0].age) | .name]
["Cat","Dan"]
. ❯ :push $_
a stage can't use $_: it changes with every line. Use $root, or a value
. ❯ :push .[0]
stage 1: .[0]  → object, 2 keys
